HEdA Accreditation Guidelines
SR 414.205.3 — Guidelines of the Higher Education Council of 28 May 2015 for accreditation within the higher education sector (HEdA Accreditation Guidelines).
|

:NOTE [links:https://fedlex.data.admin.ch/eli/cc/2015/362]
English is not an official language of the Swiss Confederation. This translation is provided for information purposes only and has no legal force.
This English text is the consolidation of 1 August 2022. The binding German, French and Italian texts have since been consolidated to 15 July 2026, so this translation is behind current law.

:INFO
Preamble
The Higher Education Council,
on the basis of Article 30 paragraph 2 of the Higher Education Act of 30 September 2011 (HEdA) and Article 2 paragraph 2 letter b number 1 of the Federal-Cantonal Agreement of 26 February 2015 on Cooperation in Higher Education,
ordains:
|

